d}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T16:26:39Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T16:26:39Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113537#issuecomment-3652678739 documented an expected slight CPU usage increase. Since the MR's impact on CPU usage (~1%) was accepted, this is a likely intended consequence.\n\nI'll wait for @Chestnut45's confirmation of this before closing this as not a bug. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687232144/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687919656","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114293#issuecomment-3687919656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114293","id":3687919656,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7b0TAo","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T20:44:16Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T20:44:16Z","body":"What puzzles me is that even with `low_processor_mode` enabled for my project, the CPU usage still increases when no operations are being performed. I wonder if it could be made into a project setting? For a regular GUI application, slight input latency shouldn't be a major issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687919656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687929154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114293#issuecomment-3687929154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114293","id":3687929154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7b0VVC","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T20:49:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T20:49:32Z","body":"Meanwhile, I noticed that if I switch to the native Wayland window, the CPU usage is almost zero under the same conditions. Is this difference due to a flaw in X11 itself?\n<img width=\"593\" height=\"190\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c86d946-9aa2-4404-acdf-caa82cc090e9\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687929154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687964071","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114293#issuecomment-3687964071","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114293","id":3687964071,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7b0d2n","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T21:05:39Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T21:05:39Z","body":"An increase in CPU usage makes sense since X11 is polling for input more frequently. Low processor mode allows the engine not to run process and rendering code, but it still needs inputs to be handled each frame. \n\nAdditionally, the code changed was only for x11, so that's why you don't see the same change with Wayland. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687964071/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687978432","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114293#issuecomment-3687978432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114293","id":3687978432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7b0hXA","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-23T21:12:22Z","updated_at":"2025-12-23T21:12:22Z","body":"> Additionally, the code changed was only for x11, so that's why you don't see the same change with Wayland.\n\nEven before the merge of #113537, the x11 window still had slight CPU usage, while the Wayland window's CPU usage was essentially zero. Is it impossible to eliminate the unnecessary CPU usage of the x11 window at the code level in Godot?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3687978432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3690389589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114293#issuecomment-3690389589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114293","id":3690389589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7b9uBV","user":{"login":"Chestnut45","id":48457382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDU3Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48457382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45","html_url":"https://github.com/Chestnut45","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chestnut45/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-24T19:05:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-24T19:05:05Z","body":"> [#113537 (comment)](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113537#issuecomment-3652678739) documented an expected slight CPU usage increase. Since the MR's impact on CPU usage (~1%) was accepted, this is a likely intended consequence.\n> \n> I'll wait for [@Chestnut45](https://github.com/Chestnut45)'s confirmation of this before closing this as not a bug.\n\nYes, this seems within the bounds of what I documented, so I would consider this expected, thank you for linking the comment!\n\nI would welcome this becoming a project option in the future, but we definitely cannot let the _wait_for_events call wait indefinitely with no other option, as letting the input thread go to sleep is (I'm 95% sure) what causes the dropped inputs in the first place. The input delay issue makes mouse motion unnacceptably bad for almost all Linux users (do take a look at the attached videos in the original comment for #113537 to see how bad it is), save for those with a high enough refresh rate that it's harder to notice, or with a high enough polling rate mouse / touchpad to wake the event thread more often, making the issue occur much less frequently.\n\n@scgm0 I'll test your PR in the next couple days to see if it doesn't re-introduce the input issue, it would be pretty cool if we could eliminate the issue and keep CPU usage even lower, but I'd be surprised if we could have our cake and eat it too 😅 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3690389589/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]